    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Give me a break! Give me "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Sudoku",
            "zh": "数独"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! Let’s play the game with numbers!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Usually, there are 9 "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rows",
            "zh": "行"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and 9 "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "columns",
            "zh": "列"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in a Sudoku "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "puzzle",
            "ref": "v-puzzle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". There are also 9 "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sub-grids",
            "zh": "子格"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—in 3×3 groups. You can use each "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "digit",
            "zh": "数字"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from 1 to 9 only once in any column, row or sub-grid."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A number game"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "French newspapers were giving readers number puzzles in the 1800s. In 1979, a new type of number puzzle "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "appeared",
            "ref": "v-appear"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It was called “Number Place”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In 1986, a Japanese puzzle company gave this type of puzzle the name “Sudoku”. It means “"
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "single",
            "ref": "v-single"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " number”. Today, Sudoku has become popular all over the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A “brain game”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sudoku is fun, and it is more than a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pastime",
            "ref": "v-pastime"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As a “brain game”, Sudoku puzzles are not always easy. Sometimes you get "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "stuck",
            "zh": "被难住"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Playing Sudoku helps you learn how to think. It also teaches you to never "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "give up",
            "zh": "永不放弃"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". You can play it anytime, anywhere!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
